ldren":[],"properties":{"html":"main","source":"main"}},{"type":"text","value":" but not\nreleased yet, use the packages from a checkout."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"from-tarballs","children":[{"type":"text","value":"From tarballs"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A checkout packs every package the way it would be published, as compiled\nJavaScript with declarations and the engine as its own per-platform package:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"vp run engine          # the engine for this machine\nbun run kirana:pack    # tarballs in packages/kirana/dist-packages","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">vp</span> run engine          <span class=\"th-token th-comment\"># the engine for this machine</span>\n<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">bun</span> run kirana:pack    <span class=\"th-token th-comment\"># tarballs in packages/kirana/dist-packages</span>","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Point your project at those tarballs, including the ones it does not name itself,\nthrough your package manager's overrides. With npm or Bun:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@kirana-style/core\": \"file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-core-0.1.0.tgz\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"kirana-style\": \"file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-0.1.0.tgz\",\n    \"@kirana-style/vite\": \"file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-vite-0.1.0.tgz\"\n  },\n  \"overrides\": {\n    \"@kirana-style/compiler\": \"file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-compiler-0.1.0.tgz\",\n    \"@kirana-style/rolldown\": \"file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-rolldown-0.1.0.tgz\",\n    \"@kirana-style/compiler-linux-x64-gnu\": \"file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-compiler-linux-x64-gnu-0.1.0.tgz\"\n  }\n}","lang":"json","html":"{\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;dependencies&quot;</span>: {\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;@kirana-style/core&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-core-0.1.0.tgz&quot;</span>\n  },\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;devDependencies&quot;</span>: {\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;kirana-style&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-0.1.0.tgz&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;@kirana-style/vite&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-vite-0.1.0.tgz&quot;</span>\n  },\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;overrides&quot;</span>: {\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;@kirana-style/compiler&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-compiler-0.1.0.tgz&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;@kirana-style/rolldown&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-rolldown-0.1.0.tgz&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;@kirana-style/compiler-linux-x64-gnu&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;file:/path/to/dist-packages/kirana-style-compiler-linux-x64-gnu-0.1.0.tgz&quot;</span>\n  }\n}","file":"package.json","title":"package.json"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"pnpm reads the same map from "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"overrides","source":"overrides"}},{"type":"text","value":" in "},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"pnpm-workspace.yaml","source":"pnpm-workspace.yaml"}},{"type":"text","value":", and Yarn from\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"resolutions","source":"resolutions"}},{"type":"text","value":". This is what CI does on every change: it installs the tarballs with\nnpm, pnpm, Yarn (both linkers) and Bun on Linux, macOS, Windows and Alpine, builds\nan example, and checks its styles in a browser. No package runs an install script,\nso there is nothing to allow-list."}]},{"type":"component","name":"callout","tagName":"md-callout","attributes":{},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Yarn looks up all eight platform packages to write its lockfile, even the seven\nit will not install. A tarball set packed on one machine has only that\nmachine's, so use npm, pnpm or Bun there."}]}],"properties":{"kind":"note","title":"Yarn needs every platform"}},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"id":"from-a-checkout-of-the-repository","children":[{"type":"text","value":"From a checkout of the repository"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Kirana lives in a Bun workspace alongside the apps that use it. In that setup an\napp depends on the packages by workspace protocol:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"{\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@kirana-style/core\": \"workspace:*\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": {\n    \"@kirana-style/vite\": \"workspace:*\"\n  }\n}","lang":"json","html":"{\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;dependencies&quot;</span>: {\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;@kirana-style/core&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;workspace:*&quot;</span>\n  },\n  <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;devDependencies&quot;</span>: {\n    <span class=\"th-token th-property\">&quot;@kirana-style/vite&quot;</span>: <span class=\"th-token th-string\">&quot;workspace:*&quot;</span>\n  }\n}","file":"apps/your-app/package.json","title":"apps/your-app/package.json"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"To use Kirana from a project outside the repository, link the packages from a\ncheckout:"}]},{"type":"component","name":"code","tagName":"md-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"source":"cd kirana/packages/kirana/npm/core && bun link\ncd ../vite && bun link\ncd /your/project && bun link @kirana-style/core @kirana-style/vite","lang":"bash","html":"<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">cd</span> kirana/packages/kirana/npm/core &amp;&amp; <span class=\"th-token th-command\">bun</span> link\n<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">cd</span> ../vite &amp;&amp; <span class=\"th-token th-command\">bun</span> link\n<span class=\"th-token th-prompt\">$</span> <span class=\"th-token th-command\">cd</span> /your/project &amp;&amp; <span class=\"th-token th-command\">bun</span> link @kirana-style/core @kirana-style/vite","variant":"terminal"}},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The native engine comes from the checkout's build ("},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"vp run build","source":"vp run build"}},{"type":"text","value":" there, or\n"},{"type":"inlineComponent","name":"inline-code","tagName":"md-inline-code","attributes":{},"children":[],"properties":{"html":"vp run engine","source":"vp run engine"}},{"type":"text","value":")."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"installation","text":"Installation","level":1},{"id":"let-kirana-style-init-do-it","text":"Let kirana-style init do it","level":2},{"id":"pick-your-framework","text":"Pick your framework","level":2},{"id":"install-by-hand","text":"Install by hand","level":2},{"id":"machines-without-a-native-build","text":"Machines without a native build","level":2},{"id":"what-every-setup-has","text":"What every setup has","level":2},{"id":"1-the-bundler-plugin","text":"1. The bundler plugin","level":3},{"id":"2-the-configuration-file","text":"2. The configuration file","level":3},{"id":"3-the-stylesheet-entry","text":"3. The stylesheet entry","level":3},{"id":"4-the-sx-prop-s-types","text":"4. The sx prop's types","level":3},{"id":"browsers","text":"Browsers","level":2},{"id":"check-it-worked","text":"Check it worked","level":2},{"id":"unreleased-changes","text":"Unreleased changes","level":2},{"id":"from-tarballs","text":"From tarballs","level":3},{"id":"from-a-checkout-of-the-repository","text":"From a checkout of the repository","level":3}]}
